UPDATE content_items SET draft_json=json_set(draft_json,'$.body',json_extract('{"v":"## What to Look For\n\nVisible light points become part of the letter design. Use this sample to discuss the relationship between the artwork, return depth, surface finish and the selected lighting components.\n\n## Light-point layout\n\nReview point size, spacing and the number of lights that each stroke can accommodate at the intended letter height.\n\n## Service & connection\n\nDiscuss component access, cable routing, power arrangements and the site exposure before agreeing the construction.\n\n## Plan Your Own Sign\n\nSend a logo or reference image with approximate dimensions, destination and intended mounting position. Confirm the component type and any required documents for the quoted configuration."}','$.v')),published_json=json_set(published_json,'$.body',json_extract('{"v":"## What to Look For\n\nVisible light points become part of the letter design. Use this sample to discuss the relationship between the artwork, return depth, surface finish and the selected lighting components.\n\n## Light-point layout\n\nReview point size, spacing and the number of lights that each stroke can accommodate at the intended letter height.\n\n## Service & connection\n\nDiscuss component access, cable routing, power arrangements and the site exposure before agreeing the construction.\n\n## Plan Your Own Sign\n\nSend a logo or reference image with approximate dimensions, destination and intended mounting position. Confirm the component type and any required documents for the quoted configuration."}','$.v')),version=version+1 WHERE type='project' AND slug='exposed-light-reference' AND status='published' AND replace(json_extract(draft_json,'$.body'),char(13),'')=json_extract('{"v":"## What This Reference Shows\n\nVisible light points on a letter from supplier material. The photograph comes from our supplier''s brochure. It is not presented as a Custom Sign Forge customer project, and no client, 